[22.715916, "o", "+----+------+-----+-----------+\r\n| ID | name | age | is_active |\r\n+----+------+-----+-----------+\r\n| 2  | Anna |  22 |   False   |\r\n+----+------+-----+-----------+\r\n"]
[22.715949, "o", ">>>Введите команду: "]
